PEAK MOVEMENT PER dB SPENT | no new simulations; committed probe artifacts only
  ln/dB_dc and ln/dB_bo are median per-design |d_ln_peak| / |d_(that quantity)|,
  over the designs where the peak moved by at least one grid step. Higher is
  cheaper. They are ratios of measured slopes, not a new experiment.

